## Reproduce

Serve with `python3 -m http.server 4173 --bind 127.0.0.1`. Run each `tests/*.test.cjs` with Node, then `node tests/browser.cjs` and `node tests/full-audit.cjs`. Set `RM_CHROMIUM_PATH` when using an existing Chromium executable; set `RM_TEST_URL` for an authenticated accessible preview. External asset reads in these two browser suites are blocked deliberately; the HTTP/PDF/media audit above is a separate check.

